      "50% advance payment is required for event confirmation.",
      "Remaining 50% balance payment must be paid before the event.",
      "Any additional requirements or services requested after quotation approval will be charged separately."
    ],
    "notes": "Revised quotation with updated pricing",
    "revisionOf": null
  }
}

